  "description": "ITC FileNet Activities\n\nThis NuGet package contains UiPath custom activities that wrap IBM FileNet .NET client capabilities for RPA:\n - FileNet Connect — authenticate and get IObjectStore\n - FileNet Execute Query — run SearchSQL and return DataTable + IRepositoryRowSet\n - FileNet Download Document — download first content element to disk, returns FileInfo\n - FileNet Disconnect — clear thread credentials (SetThreadCredentials(null))\n\nFeatures:\n - Built for .NET Framework 4.6.1 and UiPath Studio 2021/2023 Windows legacy compatibility\n - ContinueOnError options on activities\n - Safe streaming with progress logging\n - Overwrite or generate unique filenames for downloads\n - Minimal external reflection — compiled against FileNet .NET client DLLs",
  "iconFile": "UiPathLogo.png",
