  "releaseNotes": "1.0.0 — Initial release\n- Implemented Connect, Disconnect, ExecuteQuery and DownloadDocument activities\n- Added logging, ContinueOnError, and safe file naming/overwrite behavior\n- Target .NET Framework 4.6.1",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
  "summary": "Custom UiPath integration package for IBM FileNet, enabling secure connection, document handling, and repository interaction.",
